    "description": "A Speak & Spell voice: LPC frames carried in the patch, spoken through the TMS5220 tables. tools/lpc-encode.mjs turns any WAV into words. Try: Every key says the name. Raise pitch for helium, lower speed to stretch the words without dropping the voice, and loop to let it stammer forever — then encode a recording of your own with tools/lpc-encode.mjs. Generated by tools/node-demos.mjs. Do not edit by hand.",
